# Milestone: M3
# Covers: a strand calls sleep(1ms); it is removed from the ready queue,
#         inserted into the sleep queue (sched_strand_block with
#         USTRAND_REASON_SLEEP), and resumed after the timer fires.
#
# defer-to: T43 + T39
#
# Reason: sleep() / 100ms time literals are not wired at M3.  T43 adds
# time-literal lex (100ms, 1s) and the sleep() built-in.  T39 adds the
# ## host: clock-tick mechanism needed to advance the VM clock and trigger
# the sleep-queue wakeup from a chk fixture.
#
# When T43 + T39 land, implement this fixture by:
#   ## host: set mock clock
#   sleep(1ms); echo("awake")
#   ## host: advance clock by 2ms, step VM
#   --- expected output ---
#   [00000001] "awake"
